Fluid Depends On
Select how the DePortioner defines the material and the amount of the fluid that is to be created.
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• Fixed
Set the material and the amount per MU in the dialog items Material and Amount per MU.
• MU Name
Set the material and the amount per MU in the Mapping Table.
• MU Attribute
