Mapping Table
Type the name of the Mapping Table into the text box.
Remarks
The Mapping Table contains the MU Name of the arriving MU, and the Material and the Amount of the
fluid which the DePortioner creates.
The Mapping Table applies if you select MU Name for the setting Fluid Depends On.
You can also click 
  and select the Mapping Table.
